; ===== intro =====
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:51.90,Default,All,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:57.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Hello everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.45,Default,All,0,0,60,,We're HKT48!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:12.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yes! HKT48 Live Event "Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha" has finally begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:21.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,First, an a cappella version of Seishun no Deguchi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,then Kagi to Naru, with lyrics by Aki-chan and music by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:28.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,then Chime wa LOVE SONG and 12 Byou — four songs in a row you've just heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is everyone having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:35.25,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:41.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We started out with no idea which song would come first,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:42.47,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,up to here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:44.49,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and everyone must be nervous about how to get into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:46.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,whether it is okay to do the calls and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.45,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Feel free to do it the way you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.50,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:53.23,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Now, let's do self-introductions, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:54.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today's theme is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:58.55,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,your favorite song — one by one, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:14:59.32,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:00.73,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I want to wrap your heart up as Kuru-mi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:04.47,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'm Takemoto Kurumi — Kuru-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:05.79,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kuru-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.45,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.67,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Okay, my favorite song is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:13.00,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,um, what was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.94,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,What was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.46,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,What kind of song was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.34,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,What was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:18.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's that one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.02,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,My favorite song is that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:20.72,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.74,0:15:23.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Isn't it Aitakatta?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:27.04,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,But it's called Yaruki Hanabi —
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:30.98,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I remembered! Yaruki Hanabi is the song I sang at my audition, and I like it, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:34.58,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I really love Matenrou no Kyori,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:38.52,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,because when something frustrating happens, listening to Matenrou on the way home is amazing —
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:43.34,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,it lets me bask in the feeling that I'm doing my best, so I love it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.26,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:50.77,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,When I point the mic at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:51.99,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,please say "Risaki"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:53.47,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:54.59,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:55.71,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:56.72,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:57.60,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.69,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I caught everyone's hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:03.87,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Thank you! I'm 19-year-old Oba Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:04.71,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ri-sa-ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:08.00,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:13.03,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,My favorite song is Namioto no Orgel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.73,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,which we sang at the 6th gen training camp audition too,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.01,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,and listening to it gives me so much energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.43,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,it reminds me of that camp, so I love it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:23.61,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I'll do my best today, too. Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:30.73,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,When I say "super," please say "hero"!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:32.41,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:35.81,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Bright as the sun, Hakata's super—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.15,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:38.20,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:42.00,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 21 years old, I'm Team H's Kitagawa Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.40,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.18,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:51.74,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,My favorite song is definitely Buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:55.56,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,which is also a song with a senpai I admire in the center,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:59.34,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I once got to wear the Buddy costume at a concert
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.58,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and perform it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:05.00,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,but I haven't gotten to take Jiina-san's position yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:07.24,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,so I hope I can someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.68,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Please be good to me all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.92,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.65,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Well then, maybe I'll do the one I haven't sung in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:16.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:17.87,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:18.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:21.27,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:24.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today is the Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha show —
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,let's all sing together and have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:29.01,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:30.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:34.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm HKT48 Team KIV's Sakamoto Erena — Ere-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:35.69,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ere-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:40.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,My favorite song is Boku dake no Hakujitsumu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,a lovely, lovely song,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:50.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and the lyrics are so bittersweet that I love it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:56.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The lyric in the chorus about how you still can't resent anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:59.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,makes me think as I sing, "why are you so devoted?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:05.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's such a bittersweet, wonderful song that I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:07.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I can sing it again someday. Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:16.00,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Okay! The A in Aki is the A in Asura, but my heart is a bodhisattva's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:19.23,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Still in training, 25 years old — I'm Aki, Toyonaga Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:28.24,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Thank you! My favorite song is the one from the costume I'm wearing right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:34.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Kiss wa Matsu Shika Nai no Deshou ka? I love it so much, and even among HKT songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:37.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,the lyrics feel poetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.32,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and I especially love the 2nd verse,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:41.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"the corridor on a rainy day,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.38,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,that feeling of "maybe I'll get to see him,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:44.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Aww, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:48.03,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,that feeling is what I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.11,0:18:50.79,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and it's also a song with lots of memories with Ere-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.05,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,a song full of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Today's show has lots of songs packed with all kinds of memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:55.93,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:57.67,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'm counting on you all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:59.07,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.30,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,When I point the mic at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.68,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,please say "fuu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:13.18,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,In charge of warm smiles — I'll turn today into an eternal day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.98,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, born in summer, 18 years old, I'm Izawa Miyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:19.76,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please treat me well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:31.59,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,My favorite song is Cinderella Nante Inai,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:37.47,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and I love seeing Sono-san dancing in the center so gorgeously and elegantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:41.05,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and the lyrics are full of foreshadowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:43.55,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,foreshadowing planted here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:47.81,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and how it all gets paid off at the very end — I love that part so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:50.35,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so Cinderella Nante Inai is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:51.95,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.37,0:19:59.07,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,When I point the mic at you, please say "Hanchaka-chan"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.28,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Everyone's love, tied together by bonds —
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:05.04,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hanchaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.90,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:09.92,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,From Oita Prefecture, a 3rd-year middle schooler, 14 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.70,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I'm Ihara Hanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:12.74,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please call me Han-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.80,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Thanks in advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:14.88,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Han-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:19.30,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Thank you so much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.77,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,My favorite song is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:24.09,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Souiu Koto February,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:28.89,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,which is also a Team KIV song,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:32.11,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and I love its call too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.19,0:20:36.91,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and thanks to Souiu Koto February, I found out that February means Friday,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:37.68,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:39.45,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Yeah, it's totally Friday!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.91,0:20:40.29,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:41.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Friday — "Friday"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's not Friday!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:43.65,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,It's February, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.73,0:20:44.57,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Is it winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:46.29,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's not even winter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:48.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Hang in there, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:50.11,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Get it together, will you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:51.43,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Oh, February?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.05,0:20:55.65,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Right, Friday —
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:21:00.81,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,There's no way graduation ceremonies happen every Friday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:02.55,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Sorry, they do happen, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:04.43,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I just learned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.23,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please look after me for the whole day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:13.24,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,When I say "I want to be," please say "I want to be"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:13.88,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:18.46,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I want to be a gentle flower blooming in Hakata!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:20.70,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:21.90,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:24.62,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm Yuka-chan, who loves acting and guitar — Akiyoshi Yuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.36,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yuka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.69,0:21:29.80,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:35.39,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,My favorite song is AKB48's Shonichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:36.55,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It's a great song, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.97,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,The part about how effort never betrays you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:42.97,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I always keep going with those words in my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:48.25,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and "let's dance like our lives depend on it, let's sing like our lives depend on it,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:51.87,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and the part about going all out without losing your original resolve — I love that so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:55.15,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,so today I want to give it my all too,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.63,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,so everyone, let's throw the ball together too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:58.47,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:08.53,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Yes! The eight of us in HKT48's Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha will be with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:09.55,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,From here,

; ===== mc1 =====
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,since Kuru-tan and Aki-chan need to get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:12.84,Default,All,0,0,60,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:15.24,Default,All,0,0,60,,Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:18.27,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Well then, with just these members,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.35,0:22:19.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd like to chat for a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:21.19,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and we finally made it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:26.45,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We'd been saying it for so long, and finally
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:29.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,we've reached this day. I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:36.59,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Erena-san gathered this lineup, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:38.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:41.93,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I just love each of your voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:43.27,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:47.65,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I heard you singing your parts in the shows and at concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:51.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I gathered the people I thought, "I like her singing."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:54.62,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Richaki, you said you couldn't hit the low notes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.70,0:22:55.26,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.34,0:22:55.78,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.08,0:22:58.10,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,The low part of 12 Byou.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:22:59.68,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:03.50,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,With Han-chan, at first during rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:07.02,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,when I was alone I wasn't very confident and it didn't come out much,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:10.88,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,but when I sang together with Han-chan, my fellow batch-mate, I feel it came out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:11.52,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:12.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:13.46,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.14,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,"I'll give you a jewel..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.14,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,It's low. It's low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:20.22,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,12 Byou is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:25.68,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Erena-san taught me a lot too, and said things like "relax" at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,like a vocal teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:29.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone came to listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:35.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and Zawa-chan and the others, at the final rehearsal, right before the overture started,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:37.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,asked, "Erena-san, what should I do here?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:40.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,even though the music was saying "Are you ready?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:42.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I said, "Come in here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:44.44,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So when the curtain opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.70,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,in the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:47.14,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,when I rewatched the rehearsal video,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:48.02,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,it was just Erena-san and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.67,0:23:50.51,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,doing it like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.31,0:23:53.27,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,There must have been more chances to listen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.87,0:23:58.39,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Since it started a cappella, there was a lot of tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.39,0:23:59.07,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,It's the first time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:01.13,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's the first since THE LIVE, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:02.49,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Starting a cappella.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:04.77,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,THE LIVE was held during the COVID era, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.59,0:24:07.27,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,A live in the lesson studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.12,0:24:09.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today I think we'll get to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:12.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,each person's singing voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:13.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Han-chan, how are you doing? Today isn't Friday, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:15.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:18.56,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I'm glad I learned it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:23.00,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I was really happy to be picked for this singing selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:27.60,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I loved singing even before I joined HKT,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:32.48,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and I'm glad I trained my voice and practiced since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.56,0:24:37.26,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd heard Han-chan works really hard at voice training,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:43.14,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I could feel her growing fast in the shows we do together,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:45.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I wanted Han-chan to be in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.94,0:24:46.66,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Thank you, teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.42,0:24:48.82,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:50.10,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,She's a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:50.70,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So reliable!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:51.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:55.72,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Also, this time the ticket competition was pretty fierce, wasn't it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.80,0:24:56.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The S seats and such,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:58.42,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,a first-time attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.50,0:25:02.92,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I heard the competition for S seats was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:05.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's hard to apply, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.72,0:25:06.07,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.15,0:25:06.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:08.40,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm so happy it's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.48,0:25:08.86,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Full!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.94,0:25:11.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Also, people said the title, Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.48,0:25:13.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,sounds a bit like a hot spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.44,0:25:16.88,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,like "some-kind-of-leaf Hot Spring," we were saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and there really is one in Fukuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.82,0:25:20.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's definitely not a bedrock spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:22.24,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:24.62,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Speaking of which, on today's welcome board,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.70,0:25:26.64,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,since there are eight of us, each of us
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.72,0:25:28.14,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,— what do you call it, a live house? —
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.22,0:25:31.26,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,made our own logo like a live house,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:33.96,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and wrote it on the welcome board,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:35.76,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,did you all see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:36.50,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:40.08,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I tried to make it look like a live house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:41.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We each came up with our own logos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:42.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.46,0:25:45.52,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I thought Akiyoshi-san's was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:46.28,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:49.70,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,there's a yakitori restaurant in Osaka
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.78,0:25:50.98,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,called Akiyoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.06,0:25:53.18,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and I did a little homage to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.08,0:25:55.12,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I did it in a fairly subdued,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:56.88,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,comedy-sketch style.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.96,0:25:59.14,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,By the way, I'm also called Zawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:01.04,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Izawa, like
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:02.36,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,like, "Zawa."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.94,0:26:04.80,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Huh? What, what, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.88,0:26:08.34,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I did a little homage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.42,0:26:09.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's an homage?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:11.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:14.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So the welcome board is worth a look, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:18.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So — HKT48 Live
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:19.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:22.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Is everyone ready to get even more excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.40,0:26:26.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:27.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,From here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:30.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please enjoy all sorts of songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:31.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please enjoy!

; ===== mc2 =====
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:18.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.90,0:43:22.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We've performed our unit songs and solo songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.36,0:43:23.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so how was it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.77,0:43:31.89,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,With Candy, we handed out voice-care throat lozenges —
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.97,0:43:33.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,was everyone okay up above?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.71,0:43:36.81,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Did any hit you? There are quite a lot scattered around,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.89,0:43:39.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I picked a few up — I picked some up while we were singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.83,0:43:41.81,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This song, Motto, Kitto,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.89,0:43:45.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is one where, a while ago, when I was put in a unit with a Stardust idol
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.55,0:43:47.93,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,on a TV show,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.01,0:43:50.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I got to write the lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.39,0:43:52.63,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I think I was 18 at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.55,0:43:56.41,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I got to write down my honest feelings back then
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.49,0:43:58.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,straight from the heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.65,0:44:00.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so it came out as a very straightforward song,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.95,0:44:03.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I wanted to deliver it to you all once more at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.25,0:44:05.09,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,from who I am now,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.17,0:44:06.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I sang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.43,0:44:08.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.09,0:44:11.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.09,0:44:16.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The voice-care ones are still lying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.99,0:44:21.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Is it okay to leave these now? Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.49,0:44:23.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Are you ready? Not yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.31,0:44:25.51,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Ready yet? Oh, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.59,0:44:29.35,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, I have to get ready too, so I'll pass the baton to the next people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.43,0:44:30.15,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.40,0:44:37.30,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.40,0:44:39.10,Default,All,0,0,60,,Yay!!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.98,0:44:47.36,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,From here, the four of us will take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.44,0:44:48.72,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,The 6th gen, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.24,0:44:50.40,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,We're all 6th gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.86,0:44:51.46,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,That we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.04,0:44:55.30,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,We'll carry on like this while we get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.06,0:44:59.30,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Just now there was the unit corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:03.10,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and Aki-san was super cool right off the bat, wasn't she, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.30,0:45:04.14,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From the very start, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.68,0:45:05.70,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,It was truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.88,0:45:07.94,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.00,0:45:14.88,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I heard Aki-san made that dance herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.96,0:45:17.44,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,That's amazing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.52,0:45:21.64,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,During rehearsal I was watching from the audience seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.72,0:45:24.72,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and the choreography was already perfect at rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.34,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so I thought, "oh, so that choreography existed,"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.42,0:45:30.96,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but she said she came up with those moves right there at rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.04,0:45:32.70,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and she was dancing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.38,0:45:34.24,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,which I thought was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.32,0:45:36.74,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,That's talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.82,0:45:38.74,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Kurumi-san did a solo song too,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.82,0:45:40.28,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,and she was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:42.82,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Her singing voice was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.90,0:45:44.50,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,She's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.00,0:45:47.22,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,After that, we
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:49.00,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,did Candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:50.62,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,the three of us with Yuka-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.70,0:45:51.90,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.40,0:45:54.20,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,the candies we handed out to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.28,0:45:56.44,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,are actually ones that care for your throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.52,0:45:57.48,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,voice care,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.10,0:45:59.54,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,the ones that came flying through partway
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:00.90,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,have lozenges in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.98,0:46:03.40,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,And normally, with a song called Candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.08,0:46:09.28,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,you'd think it'd have cute strawberry milk or other sweet candies inside, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.08,0:46:13.92,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,but those were voice-care throat lozenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.76,0:46:20.16,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,And what's really funny is that Akiyoshi-san came up with the idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.36,0:46:26.50,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yuka-san wanted everyone to look after their throats partway through,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.58,0:46:29.52,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,so it started with wanting to hand out those lozenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:30.78,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,so take care of your throats and call out for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.86,0:46:32.30,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yes, yes, that's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.38,0:46:33.80,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,It seems everyone has taken care of their voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.88,0:46:34.88,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.96,0:46:36.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Isn't that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.64,0:46:37.76,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,It's quite fast, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.38,0:46:39.90,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Well then, since we are ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.98,0:46:44.06,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,from here we'd like you to listen to two songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.14,0:46:44.62,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.76,0:46:50.14,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.22,0:46:51.82,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.90,0:46:52.56,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please enjoy!

; ===== mc3 =====
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.14,0:52:29.00,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Now, let's switch members.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.17,0:52:31.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That was new,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.97,0:52:33.71,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,it felt fresh, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.79,0:52:35.71,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Is it okay if I hand out some leftover candies?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.85,0:52:38.83,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,What are you, an Osaka auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.35,0:52:39.75,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.87,0:52:45.03,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,These are the best — the voice-care lozenges are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.11,0:52:45.35,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.47,0:52:49.13,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Sorry, it looked like you didn't want any.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.18,0:52:53.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:57.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Next, the four of us will sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.72,0:52:58.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.02,0:53:00.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.80,0:53:01.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please enjoy!

; ===== premika =====
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.97,0:55:53.37,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You've listened to Boku dake no Hakujitsumu —
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.40,0:55:55.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.55,0:55:57.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.45,0:56:00.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Then, next,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.04,0:56:03.07,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,yes! you can see there's a guitar out,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.15,0:56:09.95,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and from here, Ere-tan and I would like to play and sing a song we made back in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.48,0:56:15.78,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's finally its debut — well, we'll be singing it for the first time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.96,0:56:20.56,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,If it weren't for today's event, we'd have had no place to perform it,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.64,0:56:21.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's been asleep all this time, hasn't it? I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.94,0:56:24.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's a miracle, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.38,0:56:24.84,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Tuning time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:25.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.78,0:56:26.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The costume goes well with the guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.16,0:56:30.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Did you tune it—
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.46,0:56:31.50,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.58,0:56:33.88,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We made it after school and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.08,0:56:36.36,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.44,0:56:41.10,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We each wrote the lyrics for our own parts, and I did the composition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.54,0:56:44.86,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,And since it was a graduation project — suddenly —
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.72,0:56:52.41,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Since it was a graduation project — can you talk for a bit while I tune?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.55,0:56:57.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,What kind of skit is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.50,0:57:01.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We made it as a graduation project, in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.15,0:57:02.77,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,That's why,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.33,0:57:05.33,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,sorry about this, so —
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.41,0:57:06.35,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I can't get it in tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.43,0:57:07.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.42,0:57:10.82,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Since it was a graduation project, over our three years of high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.20,0:57:14.95,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,we made it on the theme of the people who looked after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.03,0:57:15.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.03,0:57:18.97,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,And the person who looked after us the most
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:21.85,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,was our vocal teacher, Mika-sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.78,0:57:24.14,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.26,0:57:31.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,we gave the song her name as its title.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.52,0:57:34.20,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,So the title —
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.28,0:57:35.42,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.06,0:57:36.74,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.82,0:57:39.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Talking like this while tuning —
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.46,0:57:41.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, done!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.94,0:57:43.98,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,The title is "Mika" —
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.00,0:57:49.22,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,we wrote it in English as MIKA.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.30,0:57:53.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We each wrote the lyrics just as our state of mind was at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.58,0:57:55.98,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I think they're honest, true-to-life lyrics, so
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:57.14,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,shall we go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.30,0:58:02.33,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.56,0:58:04.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,MIKA.

; ===== postmika =====
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.54,1:01:25.40,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm glad we got to perform it before Ere-tan graduates.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.52,1:01:29.70,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm so happy a song from back then can be performed like this, years later,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.80,1:01:32.64,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,it feels like the dots connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.90,1:01:35.20,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It'll be the key... that's not very good, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.30,1:01:36.00,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It'll be the key...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.00,1:01:38.34,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I tried saying "it'll be the key,"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.42,1:01:39.34,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,but that was a bit off, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.42,1:01:39.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.98,1:01:43.78,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Okay, then from here we'd like to sing all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.18,1:01:47.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.38,1:01:58.38,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Okay, we'll be singing two songs in a row from here,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.84,1:02:02.92,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and we'll sing with the feelings of each lyric in our hearts,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.00,1:02:05.02,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,so please pay close attention as you listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.10,1:02:06.40,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Now then, please enjoy!

; ===== allmc =====
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.36,1:11:25.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,So — you've just heard Boku wa Yatto Kimi wo Shinpai Dekiru and Zenzen Kawaranai, two songs in a row,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.40,1:11:31.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and from here I thought we'd look back a bit on the songs so far,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.84,1:11:34.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,but first, shall we pick up the candies?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.76,1:11:35.28,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.94,1:11:40.72,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I thought my jelly candy was only half there —
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.80,1:11:41.76,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,It was right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.04,1:11:44.96,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Why are you handing it over?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.04,1:11:47.42,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I want to enjoy it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.50,1:11:49.65,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh? You mean you bit it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.90,1:11:50.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No, no—
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.28,1:11:51.84,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I gave out too many of these, so—
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.88,1:11:52.92,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I was startled when I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.00,1:11:53.80,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.14,1:11:55.40,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Shall I put it down for now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.98,1:11:56.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Are you sure that's all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.88,1:11:57.95,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You're keeping hold of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.70,1:12:01.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True — we might end up throwing them after this,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.48,1:12:02.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and we did units too, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.74,1:12:09.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, my hands got sticky, and it keeps bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.84,1:12:12.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Everyone's were so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.26,1:12:14.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,And the evening show will also
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.62,1:12:15.80,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,have all kinds of corners,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.88,1:12:17.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so please look forward to those as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.82,1:12:19.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and here we'd like to take a commemorative photo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.56,1:12:24.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Ere-chan's Barcode and such, I really
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.76,1:12:26.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.32,1:12:29.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The three of you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.44,1:12:32.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Well then, shall we do it like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.34,1:12:35.96,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,And Chime wa LOVE SONG, too,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.54,1:12:37.64,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,we did it at Team TII as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.72,1:12:42.46,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,For me, 2nd gen, too, the first assignment song at my audition was Chime wa LOVE SONG.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.24,1:12:44.20,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's emotional.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.32,1:12:49.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,People tend to forget, but I was in the Team TII plus trainees opening show.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.50,1:12:50.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That right
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.68,1:12:52.48,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I do get forgotten, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.78,1:12:54.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.24,1:12:57.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.78,1:12:58.36,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.92,1:13:02.04,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Shall we try expressing Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:02.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Each of us?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.44,1:13:04.16,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Each of...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.19,1:13:16.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Next,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.03,1:13:19.67,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,what shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.45,1:13:22.47,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Squeeze it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.93,1:13:24.19,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Squeeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.66,1:13:33.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.72,1:13:35.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,what shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.68,1:13:39.93,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,We hadn't decided!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.94,1:13:40.25,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,How about
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.55,1:13:44.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,a peace sign, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.96,1:13:45.96,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.04,1:13:48.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's not something you say as filler.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.60,1:13:55.20,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.60,1:14:04.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,The next corner
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.24,1:14:06.94,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,is us performing all together once more,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.02,1:14:09.38,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and with the power of your calls,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.46,1:14:11.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,we'd like to put on the show, so
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.38,1:14:12.52,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,can you all raise your voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.10,1:14:17.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,We've had a quiet, calm stretch so far,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.68,1:14:19.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,can you be louder than usual?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.20,1:14:23.64,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,If you overdo it, have a throat lozenge afterward.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.16,1:14:25.00,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Throat lozenges!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.08,1:14:26.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Shall we take our positions, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.00,1:14:27.62,Default,All,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.09,1:14:35.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, next we start with this song.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.27,1:14:35.99,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please enjoy!

; ===== prelast =====
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.21,1:23:53.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, you've heard three songs in a row,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.69,1:23:54.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.47,1:23:58.43,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The next one will be our last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.30,1:24:04.40,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.00,1:24:07.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Sorry, and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.89,1:24:09.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It really is the last song next.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.64,1:24:11.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Now then, everyone, please listen to our last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.30,1:24:13.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please enjoy it!

; ===== lastsp =====
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.76,1:26:23.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you all so much for coming today!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.48,1:26:26.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,From here on, too, together with us,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.44,1:26:28.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,let's go out and see all kinds of scenery.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.68,1:26:29.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please look after us!

; ===== encore =====
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.50,1:28:23.90,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.70,1:28:26.10,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you so much!

; ===== enc2 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.60,1:30:46.34,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay! Let's call for an encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.30,1:30:54.62,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Encore! Encore! Encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.10,1:32:11.70,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,En-core! En-core!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.30,1:32:23.90,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Encore, encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.92,1:34:48.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you all for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.42,1:34:51.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,All right, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.76,1:34:54.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Let's get lively from here on!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.92,1:38:03.14,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, ready —
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.22,1:38:04.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.88,1:38:09.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.98,1:40:30.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.10,1:40:33.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.40,1:40:35.18,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!

; ===== imp =====
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.42,1:40:45.48,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We've come this far in Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.56,1:40:47.88,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Han-chan, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.96,1:40:52.92,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I'm happy I got to be in the Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha show,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.00,1:40:56.68,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and I'm happy I got to make memories before Ere-tan graduates,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.76,1:40:59.62,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,we made so much eye contact and interacted a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.70,1:41:01.10,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,it was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.68,1:41:02.40,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I'm having fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.32,1:41:05.46,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I had fun today.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.54,1:41:06.68,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please keep looking after me!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.40,1:41:12.78,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Richaki, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.86,1:41:18.66,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Yes — I'm really happy I got to take part in the Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha show,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.90,1:41:24.70,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,and I'd rarely done a show that focused so much on singing, so it was a lot of fun,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.02,1:41:29.88,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I got lots of advice from the seniors, and I feel like my singing got better.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.96,1:41:32.62,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I'll keep doing my best. Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.16,1:41:38.80,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Okay, then, Hiiro-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.88,1:41:44.68,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yes. Well, it felt quite different from our usual theater shows, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.88,1:41:51.68,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Like Richaki said just now, it was focused on singing, and it felt really fresh,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.24,1:41:57.42,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and this was the first time the 6th gen did a show with such a small group,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.50,1:42:02.52,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I think it's happened at our 6th-gen shows, but since it was a first this way, that felt fresh too,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.60,1:42:08.40,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and I thought I'd start by putting out an "I'm good at singing" vibe,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.88,1:42:12.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,starting with yourself, your own feelings
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.40,1:42:15.08,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I started by telling myself that I'm good,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.16,1:42:15.82,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,so,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.90,1:42:19.12,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,even though I usually talk in a pretty loud voice at MCs,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.20,1:42:20.80,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,today I've been speaking a bit more reserved,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.88,1:42:23.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,But, Hiiro, that's just about right!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.68,1:42:24.26,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.34,1:42:25.22,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.30,1:42:28.14,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Then I'll go with that vibe in my day-to-day life,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.22,1:42:30.22,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and try to keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.30,1:42:31.62,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I had fun today. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.69,1:42:38.51,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Lastly, Aki-chan, how was it? Aki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.59,1:42:41.17,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I was surprised — since it was going down the 6th gen's line,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.25,1:42:46.19,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'm on a different team from Ere-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.27,1:42:47.87,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and today it's almost all KIV,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.25,1:42:51.67,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so it felt really fresh,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.75,1:42:55.75,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,but with a show focused on singing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.83,1:42:58.23,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'd think, "oh, this is a song I've sung before,"
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.31,1:43:01.91,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and it was packed with so many memories, which made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.99,1:43:06.05,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,This time, Ere-chan designed the tumbler merch,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.81,1:43:09.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,a tumbler that fits your favorite oshi drinks just right,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.49,1:43:12.37,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,it slips in snugly,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.75,1:43:14.85,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so we hadn't made T-shirts,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.93,1:43:17.99,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,but the staff in charge made them at their own expense,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.57,1:43:20.37,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,even though we never turn our backs,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.23,1:43:22.27,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,everyone's name is on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.35,1:43:26.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,we never turn our backs, but it's a back print,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.26,1:43:28.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so I'm showing it properly now,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.84,1:43:31.02,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and this cute thing attached here
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.10,1:43:33.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,is something you can pull from the gacha machine in the lobby,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.34,1:43:36.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so please buy a white T-shirt too,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.98,1:43:40.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and make it a matching gacha with us,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.44,1:43:43.70,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I think you'll do that for us at the evening show,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.24,1:43:47.52,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Whatever happens, I'm so happy we could deliver our songs like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.60,1:43:49.24,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and I'll do my best at the evening show too. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.50,1:43:56.40,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Aki-chan said so, and it's true — it's all KIV.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.34,1:44:00.32,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Aki-chan really struggled with this part of Hajimete no Hoshi,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.46,1:44:04.62,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,because everyone else can just do it naturally —
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.70,1:44:07.58,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"Wait, wait, wait, it's really my first time, wait!"
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.53,1:44:09.97,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Your first Hajimete no Hoshi,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.05,1:44:11.69,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,since it was Hajimete no Hoshi,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.77,1:44:12.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,amazing,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.41,1:44:13.49,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so embarrassing,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.57,1:44:14.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.55,1:44:17.77,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Since it was a first-time attempt like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.85,1:44:20.15,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,doing a singing show at HKT48,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.49,1:44:21.79,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,we were nervous too,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.87,1:44:23.75,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and I think you all were nervous too,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.83,1:44:25.69,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,but you came to see us,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.77,1:44:26.99,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and watched on DMM,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.33,1:44:29.51,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and I think there are people watching from the lobby too,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.59,1:44:32.91,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,you watched over us so warmly, and I'm really happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.99,1:44:34.35,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,that we got to make this fun time
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.00,1:44:37.36,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,all together. I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.44,1:44:37.70,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.91,1:44:46.46,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Now then, from here, Ere-tan, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.02,1:44:48.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd like to go on to the last song,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.96,1:44:52.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and for the last song, I want you to sing along — together.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.10,1:44:56.78,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,If you know it, please shout along with us,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.86,1:44:59.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and let's get fired up together all the way to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.86,1:45:01.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Now then, please listen to our last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.94,1:45:02.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Nakama no Uta.

; ===== outro =====
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.90,1:48:38.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you very much for coming today!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.68,1:48:41.60,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.92,1:48:56.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please wait where you are until the staff give you directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.50,1:49:00.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We'd like to see you off, with all our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.72,1:49:04.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And now, let's finish by all greeting you together.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.40,1:49:28.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.00,1:49:31.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks very much!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.50,1:49:34.40,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you ever so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.15,1:49:36.25,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.90,1:49:39.50,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you, everyone, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.95,1:49:41.92,Default,All,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.00,1:49:43.60,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.80,1:49:46.27,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.35,1:49:47.70,Default,All,0,0,60,,Many thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.80,1:49:50.25,Default,All,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.55,1:49:53.35,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you again!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.45,1:49:57.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you for watching!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.55,1:49:59.60,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.60,1:50:02.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.50,1:50:04.15,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.80,1:50:06.40,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.40,1:50:09.75,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.90,1:50:12.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.50,1:50:14.90,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks so much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.00,1:50:19.40,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.60,1:50:24.70,Default,All,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.00,1:50:28.50,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.66,1:50:29.66,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.74,1:50:31.10,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.26,1:50:32.48,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.04,1:50:37.14,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you to everyone watching, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.46,1:50:38.42,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks a million!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.34,1:50:41.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.40,1:50:42.60,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.90,1:50:45.24,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.10,1:50:47.10,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.80,1:50:51.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.00,1:50:53.05,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.45,1:50:58.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.65,1:51:01.45,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.90,1:51:05.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, take care of your throats!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.00,1:51:09.20,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.40,1:51:11.65,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.05,1:51:12.80,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.70,1:51:16.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.40,1:51:20.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.00,1:51:24.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.30,1:51:25.70,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.90,1:51:28.50,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thanks again, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.60,1:51:31.70,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you very much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.00,1:51:46.00,Default,All,0,0,60,,Show's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.10,1:51:46.95,Default,All,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.72,1:51:51.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Now that the Oto no Ha, Koto no Ha day show is over,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.76,1:51:52.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,how was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.94,1:51:54.02,Default,All,0,0,60,,It was fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.10,1:51:55.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It was so jam-packed,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.82,1:51:59.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I wondered what kind of reaction we'd get,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.10,1:52:03.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I was nervous in parts, but we did the day show, and it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.10,1:52:07.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I was nervous, but I'm having fun now, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.52,1:52:11.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because we all shared the nerves and turned them into strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.54,1:52:13.38,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The fans were nervous too, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.10,1:52:15.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.07,1:52:18.71,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,How was today?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.99,1:52:22.79,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,How was it? I enjoyed doing the guitar-and-vocals set with Ere-tan.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.91,1:52:24.67,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.00,1:52:25.98,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It reminded me of my high school days.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.90,1:52:28.71,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It really was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.95,1:52:32.41,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We also got to perform songs we can't normally do.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.49,1:52:33.75,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Singing while accompanying yourself is rare, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.97,1:52:35.85,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True. The 6th gen too, with only the 6th gen —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:36.29,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.43,1:52:37.43,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,It was so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.95,1:52:40.05,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,As Hiiro said during the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.25,1:52:43.37,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,it was my first time performing in such a small group,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.79,1:52:45.01,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so it was fun,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.11,1:52:50.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and I was really happy we could deliver our songs together with the seniors.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.30,1:52:54.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Solo songs, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.64,1:52:57.12,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.20,1:52:59.38,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I was so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.46,1:53:01.34,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I was nervous, but I managed it,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.42,1:53:02.94,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,except I couldn't quite get the last "Anata dake",
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.02,1:53:05.36,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,so may I try it again now?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.46,1:53:07.90,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Here? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.86,1:53:11.48,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Anata dake —
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.00,1:53:12.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.36,1:53:16.42,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'm glad. I'm all right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.50,1:53:18.32,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,It had been weighing on my mind a little,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.40,1:53:19.44,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.52,1:53:20.54,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'd been saying so all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.72,1:53:21.96,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,The "Anata dake" part was a bit—
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.62,1:53:23.48,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.78,1:53:27.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I think I did well.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.08,1:53:36.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It made me realize I love singing so much that I get frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.94,1:53:39.28,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,That was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.36,1:53:40.72,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,It really was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.26,1:53:43.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Reia is watching too, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.20,1:53:49.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's a song only today's Aki-chan could have sung, so it's a perfect 100 out of 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.30,1:53:54.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It suited her so perfectly — the world of the song was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.96,1:53:57.52,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.90,1:54:03.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because everyone lent a hand like this and cheered me on,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.62,1:54:04.94,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'm looking forward to tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.24,1:54:08.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I hope everyone's hearts reached the audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.32,1:54:13.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We want to keep working together and enjoy the evening show too.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.78,1:54:15.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Well then, look forward to the next show too!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.68,1:54:16.52,Default,All,0,0,60,,Look forward to it!
